WEBVTT

00:00:00.060 --> 00:00:04.271
Deputy A deputy is an agreed stand-in who carries

00:00:04.324 --> 00:00:07.376
out specified duties for someone else during an agreed

00:00:07.442 --> 00:00:11.692
period In this case Aisha may cover Daniel’s work

00:00:11.745 --> 00:00:14.798
only after she has accepted the particular duties and

00:00:14.863 --> 00:00:17.745
dates and has the information and access she needs

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:21.179
Being named as deputy does not give her all

00:00:21.179 --> 00:00:26.416
of Daniel’s responsibilities or unlimited decision authority Any limits

00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:29.192
and unresolved arrangements must remain clear
